<title>JAPAN: Japan August retail sales fall 1.6%.</title>
<headline>Japan August retail sales fall 1.6%.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales at Japanese department stores and supermarkets fell 1.6 percent in August to 1.73 trillion yen from a year earlier, the Ministry of International Trade and Industry said on Friday.</p>
<p>A breakdown of year-on-year changes:</p>
<p>				AUG		 JUL</p>
<p>  Department stores    +0.5		-3.0</p>
<p>  Supermarkets	   -3.2		-5.4</p>
<p>  Total		    -1.6		-4.1</p>
</text>
